            "review_text": "Lkwezi\nHoi An, Vietnam6 contributions\n0\nA nice set meal.\nSep 2017 • Friends\nWe were drawn to the Bamboo Restaurant by the set meal. Sometimes it takes the 4 of us a long time to decide what to order and by having a set menu, it was a relief. Restaurant was nice, the staff were polite, the food was good. The price was great and they had a small selection of English books for sale.\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten October 3, 2017",
