            "review_title": "Review at Bamboo Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Richard T\n82 contributions\n0\nGreat vegan food in a welcoming restaurant that truly is a hidden gem in the busy tourist area of Hoan Kiem\nOct 2016 • Solo\nThis is my favorite hangout spot in Hanoi. The staff are very friendly, fluent in English and they have some great food choices for vegans. My favorites are the fried tofu with tomato sauce and the vegetable soup. As a westerner living just outside Hanoi it is a nice to have a place that is warm, welcoming and has a friendly atmosphere. The hotel receptionists are a valuable source for sightseeing ideas even outside of Hanoi, and they allow you to park your bike for free in front of the restaurant. They also have free wifi!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten November 8, 2016",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-15",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
